      "id": 7,
      "text": "ESP32-C3 SuperMini (experimental) running ESP-IDF's blink example.\nRun (F5): the board's own LED, on GPIO8, blinks at 1 Hz. It lights while GPIO8 is low.\nThe boot log and \"Turning the LED ON!\" / \"OFF!\" are in Window > Signal Analyzer, UART tab (UART0)."
